  "rightsReview": {
    "ministry_assignments": "The public UI exposes separate assignment tables, but the footer reserves rights and the observed Privacy & Policy link leads to an Under Development page. An exact bulk reuse/redistribution grant was not verified; this is not a conclusion that every Kuwait public dataset prohibits reuse.",
    "upu_reference": "The visually reviewed addressing sheet is printed 07/2002. Its 2020 HTTP modification date is not a current assignment edition. Examples are not current assignments or geometry and are not copied into the repository.",
    "paci_and_municipality": "Public service metadata, viewer access and identifiers do not establish an unrestricted address/building/parcel export or an explicit permitted address-building relation. No identity, owner, title, resident, application or parcel-feature queries were made.",
    "csb": "The landing page identifies Census 2011 and requires terms acceptance to enter; no acceptance was performed. Historical statistical geography is not current postal assignment.",
